    "children": [
      {
        "_type": "span",
        "_key": "pp3a",
        "text": "We employ industry-standard administrative, physical, and technical safety measures—including secure cloud-based data storage environments—to safeguard your data against loss, unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. However, please remember that no data transmission across the internet is entirely impenetrable, and we cannot promise absolute security."
